hello dear airbnb guests;
I am Abdullah, I am the owner of a tourism agency and I am renting my detached house in Istanbul for traveling guests.
I am ready to help in any way I can so that my guests who will stay at my house are as comfortable as possible and to solve all their problems during their stay.

